---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Advertising production: light boxes, LED neons, 3D letters | SEZMOO"
  description="Advertising production at SEZMOO: signs, light boxes, 3D lettering, large-format print, vinyl wraps, wayfinding, POS material and event production. Gdańsk, Poland."
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Advertising <span style="color:#ffd200">production.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1"><b>We design, produce and install advertising material and signage.</b> Signs, light boxes and 3D lettering through to large-format print, vinyl wraps, wayfinding systems and event material.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">Design and production sit in one place, so a job runs from the idea and the artwork through to fabrication and installation.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Design + production</span><strong>Concept and build</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Print + finishing</span><strong>Small and large format</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Installation</span><strong>On site</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Location</span><strong>Gdańsk and all of Poland</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-ext-ab51c70e-1920.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-ext-ab51c70e-800.webp 800w, /assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-ext-ab51c70e-1280.webp 1280w, /assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-ext-ab51c70e-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="Captain's Club" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption><b>Captain's Club</b><span>Signage / venue exposure</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we produce</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Signs, light boxes &amp; 3D lettering</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Exterior and interior signage: advertising signs and light boxes, 3D lettering, logos and illuminated elements.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Advertising signs</span><span>Light boxes</span><span>3D lettering</span><span>3D logos</span><span>LED neon</span><span>Illuminated advertising</span><span>Company plaques</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Large-format print &amp; outdoor</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Material for exterior and interior display – banners and posters through to large-format print and display systems.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Large-format print</span><span>Banners</span><span>Billboards</span><span>Posters</span><span>Mesh</span><span>Roll-ups</span><span>Advertising walls</span><span>Pavement signs</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Vinyl wraps &amp; surface graphics</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>We design, produce and apply advertising film on shop windows, glass, walls and other surfaces.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Shop window graphics</span><span>Glass film</span><span>Advertising film</span><span>Frosted film</span><span>Stickers</span><span>Wall graphics</span><span>Decorative film</span><span>Vehicle wraps</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Wayfinding &amp; signage systems</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Complete signage systems for offices, commercial buildings and industrial spaces – from room identification to full wayfinding.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Company signage</span><span>Office signage</span><span>Wayfinding</span><span>Information boards</span><span>Directional signs</span><span>Room signage</span><span>Visual information systems</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>POS &amp; display material</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Material that supports sales and brand presence in stores, showrooms and service spaces.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>POS material</span><span>Stands</span><span>Displays</span><span>Display units</span><span>Signs</span><span>Promotional material</span><span>Display elements</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Event production</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>The physical side of events – walls and signage through to stages, builds, print and branding of the event space.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Event walls</span><span>Stages</span><span>Builds</span><span>Event branding</span><span>Signage</span><span>Print</span><span>Set elements</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Production <span style="color:#ffd200">capabilities.</span></h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Print</h3><p>Small and large format, advertising and display material.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Film &amp; application</h3><p>Wraps, shop windows, glass, walls and advertising surfaces.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Spatial advertising</h3><p>Light boxes, signs, 3D lettering and illuminated elements.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Fabrication</h3><p>Walls, builds, POS elements and non-standard solutions.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Installation</h3><p>Transport, installation and handover on site.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-world-of-warships/"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/work/captains-club-1.avif" alt="World of Warships – Build · Event" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Build · Event</span><h3>World of Warships ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-kapka/"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/kapka/kapka-witryna.jpg" alt="Kapka Cafe – Window graphics · Venue" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Window graphics · Venue</span><h3>Kapka Cafe ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-exlantix/"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/exlantix/exlantix-premiera-marki-gdansk-fotografia-16.jpg" alt="EXLANTIX – Space branding · Launch" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Space branding · Launch</span><h3>EXLANTIX ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
